{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "title": "Scoped parametric feature-history dependencies, optional in Worldwright workspaces",
  "lifecycle": "Source-authored core only; not Rust-compiled or feature-complete",
  "rules": [
    "Direct modeling remains independent from feature histories.",
    "Document, model-node, and block-definition histories are separate edit scopes.",
    "Block instances share the definition history; instance-specific overrides require explicit records.",
    "Features reference stable earlier feature IDs; moving ahead of prerequisites is invalid.",
    "Parameter values are typed; units and dimensional expressions must be validated by shared engines.",
    "Suppress and rollback are reversible; dependent features must become blocked, never use cached stale outputs.",
    "Geometry identifiers require stable shape/subelement names, revision control, and remap diagnostics before solid features.",
    "All operations use a single Rust math engine, exposed by CAD commands and OrbWeaver nodes.",
    "Only source_authored_uncompiled entries exist as implemented code; planned entries are NOT working features.",
    "Persistence of metadata is not equivalent to generating a solid or offering a visual timeline editor."
  ],
  "counts": {
    "total": 60,
    "source_authored_uncompiled": 8,
    "planned": 52
  },
